WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.210
Acts, chapter 16.

2
00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:03.820
Paul has a vision.

3
00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:09.630
Then the story suddenly changes voice:
immediately we sought to go out to Macedonia.

4
00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:13.060
From there, we comes
and goes in 4 passages,

5
00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:14.820
all the way to Rome.

6
00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:18.850
So was the author really on board,
or is something else going on?

7
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.290
In this mission, you'll test
3 ways of reading that we,

8
00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:24.630
and what each one has to explain.

9
00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:27.380
Then you'll weigh the clues
for when Acts was written,

10
00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:29.660
and why it ends so suddenly.

11
00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:33.980
Your mission: weigh up whether the author
of Acts was really on board when he

12
00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:35.000
wrote we.
